# .lldbinit — loaded by LLDB when this file is set as the scheme's "LLDB Init File"
# (Project.swift does that for the iCube schemes) or imported from ~/.lldbinit.
#
# Installs the TXM JIT bless hook: on iOS 26 TXM devices the `brk #0x69` /
# `brk #0xf00d` handshake in AllocateExecutableMemoryRegion_LuckTXM is answered by
# LLDB writing one byte into every 16 KB page of the JIT region (the debugger write
# is what authorizes execution), exactly what StikDebug's broker script does. So
# Xcode — or any lldb attached through a debugserver — enables JIT by itself.
command script import Source/iOS/App/Project/Scripts/dolphin_jit_lldb.py
